{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33233","headline":"观山灯献徐尚书 一 · 温庭皓","name":"观山灯献徐尚书 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"一峰当胜地，万点照严城。\n势异崑冈发，光疑玄圃生。\n焚书翻见字，举燧不招兵。\n况遇新春夜，何劳秉烛行。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"温庭皓","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_33233.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33233","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}